to the same generic crate it already uses downtown.

## Verification
- `make -C tests test` green at every commit; final **188 cases /
  31,953 assertions** (format round-trip, all validator classes,
  buildCity collision-parity, loadCity round-trip, placement
  resolution).
- Fixture screenshots at each step; QA set in
  `docs/qa/screenshots/sandbox/` (local, gitignored).

## Needs human verification (menu/mouse input isn't headless)
- Editor FEEL: pan/zoom, ghost snapping, place/delete, Tab and [ ]
  cycling, the Sandbox menu page.
- Play-mode dialogue with a placed NPC (LLM present).

## Notes
- Base is `dev` (the consolidation line, PR #130). Merge order:
  #130 → this. Do not merge; review only.
- The map JSON is the LLM world-generation output contract (milestone
  #16); its validator errors are written to be model retry feedback.

Co-authored with Claude Opus 4.8.
"""

pr = retry(repo.create_pull,
           title="feat: sandbox map editor — build, populate, and play custom maps (#109-#114)",
           body=BODY, base="dev", head="feature/sandbox-map-editor", draft=True)
print(f"DRAFT PR #{pr.number}: {pr.html_url}")

for n in range(109, 115):
    issue = retry(repo.get_issue, n)
    labels = [l.name for l in issue.labels if l.name not in ("ready-for-ai", "ai-in-progress")]
    if "ai-completed" not in labels:
        labels.append("ai-completed")
    retry(issue.edit, labels=labels)
    retry(issue.create_comment,
          f"Implemented on `feature/sandbox-map-editor`. Draft PR #{pr.number} open for review (base: dev). Not merged.")
    retry(issue.edit, state="closed")
    print(f"  #{n}: closed -> PR #{pr.number}")
print("done")
